      "question": {
        ":question/id": "4f0b1b9b-0863-5cb2-867f-94ad474fb844",
        ":question/problem": "Let $a=\u27e8\\sqrt{6},2,-1\u27e9$ and $b=\u27e84,-2,-3\u27e9.$ Find ${\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b.$\n\n${\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b=$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the scalar projection formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\sqrt{6})(4)+(2)(-2)+(-1)(-3)}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+(-3)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{6}-4+3}{\\sqrt{29}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1+4\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{29}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{b\\cdot a}{|\\,a\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{b}_{x}{a}_{x}+{b}_{y}{a}_{y}+{b}_{z}{a}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1+4\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{6})^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1+4\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{11}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{-1+4\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{29}}-\\frac{-1+4\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{11}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{11}\\left(-1+4\\sqrt{6}\\right)-\\sqrt{29}\\left(-1+4\\sqrt{6}\\right)}{\\sqrt{319}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
