      "question": {
        ":question/id": "b3e4b28c-e8a8-5cbb-89ef-d351d2bc4c04",
        ":question/problem": "Let $a=\u27e8-\\sqrt{3},-\\sqrt{6},1\u27e9$ and $b=\u27e8-1,1,\\sqrt{6}\u27e9.$ Find ${\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the scalar projection formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-\\sqrt{3})(-1)+(-\\sqrt{6})(1)+(1)(\\sqrt{6})}{\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{1}^{2}+(\\sqrt{6})^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{8}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{8}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{b\\cdot a}{|\\,a\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{b}_{x}{a}_{x}+{b}_{y}{a}_{y}+{b}_{z}{a}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{(-\\sqrt{3})^{2}+(-\\sqrt{6})^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{10}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{8}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{30}-2\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{80}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
