        ":question/id": "d9750954-2644-5f46-9bc3-7cd5fcb4219c",
        ":question/problem": "Let $a=\u27e83,\\sqrt{5},1\u27e9$ and $b=\u27e8-1,-\\sqrt{3},2\u27e9.$ Find ${\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the scalar projection formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(3)(-1)+(\\sqrt{5})(-\\sqrt{3})+(1)(2)}{\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+(-\\sqrt{3})^{2}+{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3-\\sqrt{15}+2}{\\sqrt{8}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\sqrt{15}-1}{\\sqrt{8}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{b\\cdot a}{|\\,a\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{b}_{x}{a}_{x}+{b}_{y}{a}_{y}+{b}_{z}{a}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\sqrt{15}-1}{\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(\\sqrt{5})^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\sqrt{15}-1}{\\sqrt{15}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =-\\frac{1+\\sqrt{15}}{\\sqrt{8}}-(-\\frac{1+\\sqrt{15}}{\\sqrt{15}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{15}\\left(-\\sqrt{15}-1\\right)-(2\\sqrt{2}\\left(-\\sqrt{15}-1\\right))}{\\sqrt{120}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
