        ":question/id": "d2188174-52cd-511b-87a0-828e4b888f06",
        ":question/problem": "Let $a=\u27e8-1,-\\sqrt{3},4\u27e9$ and $b=\u27e8-\\sqrt{2},\\sqrt{6},\\sqrt{2}\u27e9.$ Find ${\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a+{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the scalar projection formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-1)(-\\sqrt{2})+(-\\sqrt{3})(\\sqrt{6})+(4)(\\sqrt{2})}{\\sqrt{(-\\sqrt{2})^{2}+(\\sqrt{6})^{2}+(\\sqrt{2})^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-3\\sqrt{2}+4\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{10}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{b\\cdot a}{|\\,a\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{b}_{x}{a}_{x}+{b}_{y}{a}_{y}+{b}_{z}{a}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+(-\\sqrt{3})^{2}+{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{20}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a+{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{10}}+\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{20}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{10}+4\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{200}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
